{"id":"00380","root":"uni00380_1","name":{"ja":"マヤ・コーデリア","en":"Maya Cordelia"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"マヤ・コーデリア","en":"Maya Cordelia"},"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Prison Battleship"],"release":"2020-09-25","limited":true,"characterId":236,"profile":{"ja":"先代、イェルド・コーデリア大公の娘。イェルドにはマヤしか子がなく、いずれコーデリア大公を継ぐことになる。アリシア同様、臣下や国民に絶大な人気のある姫君。後見人となったアリシアに守られながら、彼女より帝王学を学んでいる。天才肌で努力家、アリシアからその将来を嘱望されている。アリシアの溺愛のせいでやや箱入り娘の感があり、庶民の常識に欠ける部分がある。アリシアと何かと比べられる事があるが、アリシアがあまりに優秀すぎるので本人はプレッシャーとは感じていない。それよりも尊敬するアリシアに一つでも何かを認められたいと何事にも一生懸命努力している。アリシアほどではないが王者の威風と、知性と若いエネルギーに満ちた美少女である。","en":"Maya Cordelia, daughter of the late Grand Duke Yeld Cordelia, is the sole child and heir destined to succeed the Grand Duke. Like Alicia, she enjoys immense popularity among subjects and the populace. Protected by her guardian Alicia, Maya studies statecraft under her mentor. A natural genius and diligent worker, she is highly regarded by Alicia for her future potential. Because of Alicia's doting, Maya sometimes feels sheltered and lacks common folk sensibilities. Though often compared to Alicia, she does not view it as pressure, since Alicia's excellence is overwhelming. Instead, Maya strives earnestly to earn even a single acknowledgment from the respected Alicia. While not as commanding as Alicia, she possesses a regal presence, intelligence, and youthful energy, making her a beautiful young lady."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"氷室百合","forms":[{"id":"uni00380_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1286,2572],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[212,424],"def":[159,318],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["5","780004"]},{"id":"uni00380_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1772,3544],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[324,648],"def":[218,436],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["5","780004","780005"]},{"id":"uni00380_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2258,4527]